  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 604.03 Taylor River. The Taylor River from the railroad bridge to the head of tide dam in Hampton shall be closed to the taking river herring by netting of any method.\n\nSource. #1878, eff 12-4-81; ss by #2839, eff 8-31-84; ss by #4868, eff 7-20-90; ss by #6291, eff 7-20-96; ss by #8087, eff 5-27-04; ss by #8344, EXEMPT, eff 5-7-05",
